#. ja: 対象に物理攻撃。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>威力：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>230（アイテムレベル依存威力）
#. de: Du führst eine physische Attacke aus.<br>Attacke-Wert: 230 (skaliert mit Gegen<shy>stands<shy>stufe)
#. fr: Effectue une attaque physique sur la cible.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Puissance<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 230 (varie selon le niveau d'objet)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:49062:0:0"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230.<br>Potency scales with item level."
msgstr "Атакует с силой 230.<br>Сила зависит от уровня предмета."

#. ja: 一定時間、自身の回避率を20％上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>90秒
#. de: Du erhöhst deine Ausweichrate um 20<nbsp>%.<br>Dauer: 90 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 20% votre esquive.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 90s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
