msgid "Deals ice damage with a potency of 300 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br>Potency increases to 390 when used against targets weak to ice.<br>Potency scales with item level.<br>Shares a recast timer with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Fire II</ui-edge-color></ui-color><if ($gn108 >= 5)> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Thunder II</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if>."
